# `/job/shared/` and `/app/shared/` used to be listed here, one ignored and
# one tracked, because each deployable unit was synced as loose files and had
# to carry a copy of everything it imported. Both units now install this repo
# as a package, so there is one `shared/` and nothing to ignore.
.vscode/settings.json
